  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "どくそと　いわの　せいぶんを　まぜた　ガスを８つに　ふえた　シリンダーでばくはつさせ　エネルギーを　つくる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "독소와 바위 성분이 섞인 가스를 8개로 늘어난 실린더에서 폭발시켜 에너지를 만들어 낸다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在增加到了８個的汽缸裡引爆混有毒素和岩石成分的氣體來製造能量。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il produit de l’énergie en faisant exploser dans ses huit cylindres un mélange gazeux qui contient une substance toxique et des minéraux.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit seinen nunmehr acht Zylindern lässt es ein Gasgemisch aus Gift und Gesteinsmineralien explodieren, um daraus Energie zu gewinnen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Posee ocho cilindros, con los que genera energía haciendo estallar el gas que produce al mezclar los minerales de las rocas con su veneno.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Produce energia facendo esplodere nei suoi otto cilindri un gas che forma mescolando tossine e minerali delle rocce.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It creates a gas out of poison and minerals from rocks. It then detonates the gas in its cylinders— now numbering eight—to generate energy.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "毒素と　岩の　成分を　混ぜた　ガスを８つに　増えた　シリンダーで爆発させ　エネルギーを　作る。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在增加到８个之多的汽缸里引爆混有毒素和岩石成分的气体来制造能量。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Posee ocho cilindros, con los que genera energía haciendo estallar el gas que produce al mezclar los minerales de las rocas con su veneno.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "はいきおんで　はげしく　いかくする。えんとうけいの　くちから　べろを　だしてどくえきを　まきちらす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "배기음을 내어 거세게 위협한다. 원통형의 입을 통해 혀를 꺼내고는 독액을 흩뿌린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "用排氣聲猛烈威嚇對手。會從圓筒形的嘴巴吐出舌頭並噴灑毒液。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon intimide ses adversaires grâce au bruit de ses pots d’échappement et répand du liquide empoisonné à l’aide de sa langue.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Den Auspufflärm nutzt es als starke Drohgebärde. Es streckt seine Zunge aus dem zylindrischen Mund und verteilt dabei eine giftige Flüssigkeit.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Produce un ruido estrepitoso por los tubos de escape para intimidar. Saca la lengua por su boca cilíndrica y esparce un líquido venenoso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Intimidisce il nemico con il rumore assordante dei suoi scarichi. Spruzza liquido tossico dalla bocca cilindrica facendo pernacchie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Revavroom viciously threatens others with the sound of its exhaust. It sticks its tongue out from its cylindrical mouth and sprays toxic fluids.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "排気音で　激しく　威嚇する。円筒形の　口から　べろを　出して毒液を　まき散らす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "用排气的声音猛烈地威吓对手。会从圆筒形的嘴巴吐出舌头并喷洒毒液。",
      "language": {
